            "Toshio": "Confirmed.",
            "Kenji": "Okay."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "seats": {
    "Mio": "Mio is concerned about financial predictability and the lack of clear income projections. She argues for a structure that is easy to manage and understand, moving from uncertainty to a strong preference for the simplest administrative option.",
    "Toshio": "Toshio is focused on the sustainability of the treasurer's role and the administrative burden. He uses data on logged hours to argue against complex charging systems, consistently supporting the option with the lowest workload.",
